      ],
      "rationale": "Necessary purpose-bounded identifier OR record projection to a Person, never that Person. Shared Entity equality tests actual role separation. Purpose-relative sufficient selection has no sufficient proper subset; every exposed field is needed for that purpose. Removal-closed candidate Selection domain prevents omitted finite subset witnesses. Actual policy/field universe/sufficiency/meaning maps remain pending; no universal field count or byte-minimum claim.",
